 ## Background
-SF-VAE was introduced as part of the "gs-embedding" project, an unofficial implementation exploring the integration of VAEs with 3D Gaussian Splatting [S1, unofficial]. It builds upon the principles of learning-based initialization for Gaussian Splatting, aiming to improve the robustness of the initialization process by leveraging learned priors from point cloud data [S1, unofficial].
+SF-VAE was introduced in the "gs-embedding" project, an unofficial implementation exploring the integration of VAEs with 3D Gaussian Splatting [S1, unofficial]. It builds on [Learning-based and Generative Initialization](12356-learning-based-and-generative-initialization.md) by applying a structured folding mechanism to map point cloud data into Gaussian parameter space [S1, unofficial].
 
